{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-24T20:16:16.810Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did for task 3:\n\n**New modules**\n- `src/core/report/brief-to-approval.ts` — `readBriefToApprovalSeconds` reads a manifest `createdAt` marked `createdAtSource: \"created\"` and measures to `readManifestApprovedAt`, null when either endpoint is missing/invalid or approval precedes creation.\n- `src/core/report/scope-size.ts` — `taskScopeSize` returns the key count of the last `measures` end event's `scopeHashes`, else the start `scopeFiles`.\n\n**`src/core/report/report.ts`**\n- `deriveMeasuredTask` sizes tasks via `taskScopeSize`.\n- `readApprovedAtMs` now goes through `readManifestApprovedAt`; the unused brief-date readers are removed.\n- `RepositoryRecord.firstAttemptPassRate` → `firstAttemptPasses`, body prints `First-attempt passes: <passed>/<measured>`.\n- A cycle phase with zero coverage prints `not reported (0 of <m> archived changes)`.\n\n**Fixture**\n- The two archived manifests gained `.run/approved`; `expected.json` regenerated — its diff touches only cycle values (brief-to-approval and total for those pre-marker records).\n\n**Tests**\n- New `tests/report-record-accuracy.test.ts` (7 tests) covering all acceptance cases.\n- Updated `report-cycle`, `report-sizes`, and `plan` tests for the count line, marker-based brief-to-approval, and trusted approval.\n\nBoth verifies pass: the task test (7 pass) and `pnpm verify` (exit 0). Result written to `openspec/changes/072-record-bugs/.run/results/3.md`."}}
